sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant SaaS as SaaS<br/>onboarding saga
  participant SDB as PostgreSQL<br/>SaaS DB
  participant Authz as Authorizer
  participant BFF as BFF
  actor Admin as Super Admin

  SaaS->>SDB: Create tenant
  SaaS->>Authz: Create owner identity
  Authz-->>SaaS: ownerUserId

  alt Failure before subscription
    SaaS->>Authz: Disable owner identity
    SaaS->>SDB: Delete partial tenant
    SaaS-->>BFF: TENANT_ONBOARDING_FAILED
    BFF-->>Admin: Show failure
  else Failure after subscription
    SaaS->>SDB: Assign initial subscription
    SaaS--xSaaS: Downstream setup fails
    SaaS->>Authz: Disable owner identity
    SaaS->>SDB: Delete initial onboarding subscription
    SaaS->>SDB: Delete partial tenant
    SaaS-->>BFF: TENANT_ONBOARDING_FAILED
    BFF-->>Admin: Show failure
  end

  Note over SaaS,SDB: Compensation is best-effort and scoped to side effects already reached
